// Integer arithmetic that clamps instead of wrapping.
//
// The smallest thing worth proving, and the one that shows the whole shape of
// a MoonBit contract: a pre-condition naming the domain, post-conditions
// naming the result, and the machine range written down by hand. That last
// part is the one that is easy to leave out and fatal to leave out.
options(
  "proof-enabled": true,
)
